Singapore legislation in this repository

The Acts under acts/ and acts-as-passed/ are taken from the Republic of Singapore Government Gazette, Electronic
Edition (https://www.egazette.gov.sg), owned and maintained by the Government of Singapore, represented by the
Ministry of Digital Development and Information (MDDI). As clause 11 of the eGazette Terms of Use (last updated
10 July 2026) requires:

  The e-Gazettes reproduced in this repository are subject to copyright of the Singapore Government and are
  reproduced here with the permission of the Singapore Government. Readers may check the eGazette website
  (https://www.egazette.gov.sg) for the latest e-Gazettes.

Lexifina, as the operator of this repository, is responsible for the accuracy of the e-Gazettes reproduced here.
This repository is not associated or affiliated in any manner with the Government of Singapore or the eGazette
website. The Gazette was read automatically one request at a time, about one second apart, without circumventing
any security measure (clause 11). The Government may revoke or change this permission at any time. Section 48 of
the Interpretation Act does not apply to anything copied from the website: these copies are not evidence of the law.

Singapore Statutes Online (https://sso.agc.gov.sg, Attorney-General's Chambers) is not a source of any text here.

